    <string name="nika_whats_new_page_title">Nika is a screen reader built on Backtalk and Google TalkBack</string>
    <string name="nika_whats_new_page_text">What\u2019s new:\n\u2022 New section \u201cFor button phones\u201d in the main settings: actions for the volume keys, number keys, star, pound, arrows and any other key you choose. Each key can have actions for a press, a hold, a double press and a triple press.\n\u2022 You can set how long a hold is and the pause between presses.\n\u2022 Arrow keys without a modifier can be turned on and off, and left alone in text fields.</string>
